### Lesson 06 · 範例一：4 種參數接收方式

GET http://localhost:8080/books/957 HTTP/1.1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/books/search?keyword=Java&limit=10 HTTP/1.1

### limit 省略時，@RequestParam(defaultValue = "5") 生效
GET http://localhost:8080/books/search?keyword=Java HTTP/1.1

### keyword 未傳 -> 400 Bad Request（@RequestParam 預設必填）
GET http://localhost:8080/books/search HTTP/1.1

###
POST http://localhost:8080/books HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring 入門",
  "price": 500
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/books/form HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Spring 進階&price=650

### Lesson 06 · 範例二：Jackson 註解控制 JSON 樣式
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me HTTP/1.1

### Lesson 06 · 範例三：@Valid 驗證通過
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "secret123",
  "email": "ming@example.com",
  "age": 19
}

### 驗證失敗 -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": " ",
  "password": "123",
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "age": 16
}

### Lab 1：商品 CRUD
GET http://localhost:8080/products HTTP/1.1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1 HTTP/1.1

### 不存在 -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999 HTTP/1.1

### 新增 -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "無線滑鼠",
  "price": 890,
  "categoryId": 3
}

### 更新 -> 200 OK
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "筆電（特價）",
  "price": 29900,
  "categoryId": 3
}

### 刪除 -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/2 HTTP/1.1

### Lab 2：關鍵字過濾 + 分頁
GET http://localhost:8080/products?keyword=筆電&page=0&size=10 HTTP/1.1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/categories/3/products HTTP/1.1

### Lab 3：驗證失敗 -> 400（name 空白、price 非正數）
POST http://localhost:8080/products HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "price": -100,
  "categoryId": 3
}
